OL,3,GNEWSAMan sought in connection with
OL,4,A'altercation' by roadside
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Police Scotland spokesperson said the
OL,7,Fvehicle and two men had been traced,
OL,8,Fbut that officer were "concerned" for
OL,9,Fthe third man, who has not been found.
